WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:05.875
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:05.876 --> 00:00:08.684
What do they see?

3
00:00:08.685 --> 00:00:17.001
They see lots of games.

4
00:00:17.002 --> 00:00:30.803
The blobs get some coins.

5
00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:47.904
They play a space game.

6
00:00:47.905 --> 00:01:02.657
They play a boxing game.

7
00:01:02.658 --> 00:01:29.277
They play a racing game.

8
00:01:29.278 --> 00:01:52.819
They play a dancing game.

9
00:01:52.820 --> 00:02:12.171
They play a basketball game.

10
00:02:12.172 --> 00:02:33.484
They play a claw machine.

11
00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:39.793
Game over, Blobs.

12
00:02:39.794 --> 00:02:48.012
Oh, there's one more coin.

13
00:02:48.013 --> 00:02:51.920
Silly blobs.

14
00:02:51.921 --> 00:02:57.818
Good-bye!

